{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2020-12-10 16:15:00', 'title': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS FIRST QUARTER FISCAL YEAR 2021 OPERATING RESULTS', 'text': 'ISSAQUAH, WASH., DEC. 10, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION (“COSTCO” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: COST) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS OPERATING RESULTS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER (TWELVE WEEKS) OF FISCAL 2021, ENDED NOVEMBER 22, 2020.'}